{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ac2389c295011152","name":"Jedi Sentinel Master","source":{"id":"source:reference-ac2389c295011152","title":"Jedi Sentinel Master","revision":25220,"timestamp":"2024-11-13T20:05:53Z","sha256":"6c13be1586564105d4a2e4d825401a7316a8faf76fa705aa93c716d278eea81b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25220","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Sentinel%20Master&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ac2389c295011152","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Jedi Sentinels were established during the days of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"},". They were taught to withstand the influence of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", and they did so with varying degrees of success. Due to this resistance, they were often employed to actively seek out rogue Jedi and servants of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},". They were most commonly denoted by their yellow-bladed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", but this old tradition is not always adhered to.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sentinels are dangerous individuals, due to their specialized training as well as their ability to find, track, and eradicate threats to the Light without being taken over by the Dark. Because of their near-constant exposure to the servants of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", few Sentinels rise to the rank of Jedi Master. The ones who do are lauded for their strength of character, though even they are sometimes considered suspect by their peers.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Some Jedi argue that constant exposure to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," is a lure that cannot be withstood forever, even by individuals who are sworn to destroy it. For this reason, Jedi Sentinels are often viewed with wariness by their fellows in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},". Although this attitude can be a sore spot for some, it is a rare Sentinel who shows much concern about the paranoia of others. Most Sentinels take it in stride and expect nothing less.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sentinels are a rare breed of Jedi, and those who reach the rank of Jedi Master are rarer still. Despite this scarcity, they have long been a part of the Order, and the malignant plans of many evil beings have been brought to heel due to the tenacity of these brave souls.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["The Presence of a Master"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The rank of Master is conferred on Jedi who prove themselves to be not only excellent teachers, but true masters of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Though not every Master becomes a member of the Jedi Council, Jedi Masters are regarded as the ultimate authority on matters concerning ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". The presence of a Jedi Master should be a momentous event in a campaign, because a Master's wisdom and knowledge is usually unparalleled. Even experienced Jedi Knights who have years of service under their belts pause to show a Jedi Master the proper respect, and those who come to the rank at a young age (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Obi-Wan Kenobi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Obi-Wan_Kenobi","referenceId":"reference:6e84377ee76928db"},") are both rare and revered.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Including a Jedi Master in your campaign can cause some problems if not properly handled. For one, the heroes might come to rely on the power that a Jedi Master wields if the Master spends much time accompanying them. Similarly, some heroes might think they can use the Jedi Master to solve all their problems, calling upon the Master's knowledge and experience even for the most trivial matters. Finally, some players might feel as though their heroes are outshined by a prominent Jedi Master appearing in the campaign, and they could come to resent the Master as a character much more powerful than their own.\n"]},"\n","\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Jedi Sentinel Master Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A Sentinel who has risen to the rank of Jedi Master makes an excellent mentor or patron, either for a single Jedi or for a group of heroes; such an individual is not above using others to help him in his effort to destroy Dark Side influences. A Sentinel Master might also be employed as an opponent for characters who continually flaunt their power in malicious and inappropriate ways. In the case of characters who are lost to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", a Sentinel Master and his allies present the players with a difficult long-term enemy to avoid or defeat.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Sentinel Master is a sworn enemy of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", but they are not a foolish adversary. He or she will often bide their time, using their powers and contacts in an effort to isolate and judge his enemies. Once he or she has done their research, a Sentinel Master acts as judge, jury, and executioner. They are not above allowing their enemies to repent their wicked ways, but such a decision is rarely made lightly.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Jedi Sentinel Master Statistics (CL 16)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," 7/",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Knight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Knight","referenceId":"reference:8a1e23d924066b37"}," 5/",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Master"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Master","referenceId":"reference:5fac760c8a2485ba"}," 4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9, ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Foresight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Foresight"}]},"; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Sense Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Sense_Force","referenceId":"reference:8f3ced475f793949"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Sense Surroundings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Sense_Surroundings","referenceId":"reference:235a3d3c923a59ff"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," +22\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, 2 Unassigned\n"]},"\n",{"